{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"0dbe1691065973cf00c88cae8f9513054dc0e85d875ace9867121829e1a436a8","ja":"スランプの理由","zh":"低谷的原因","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"51aad29999d3a0018bc9c67ec89ee08bfe9728b31a7321b16114c9bc483fafd3","ja":"みんなは、佐竹飯店に移動して\n美奈子の話を聞くことになって……","zh":"大家动身前往佐竹饭店，听美奈子讲述……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b37fa5edb121b5d90aaed55b02f31e1110e446c6a40d1da5f1ec1eae22fceb14","ja":"佐竹さんが料理を作れなくなった原因、\n思い当たることはありますか？","zh":"您知道佐竹小姐没法做饭的原因吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ac671728444802eb0d326e0e6540ca83075dca522d2787d81b4df3efbd8e8401","ja":"うん……。実はこの前、料理番組のオファーが\nあったんだけど……あ、これ、番組のサイトね。","zh":"嗯……其实前阵子有个料理节目的邀约……啊，这是节目的网址。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"05da35b0b199eb3763989dbf99d6447d3420cd2748f6cf5754f1f05963efaefc","ja":"見たことあります。人気番組ですよね。\n審査がとても厳しくて、泣いてしまう人もいるとか。","zh":"我看过。是很受欢迎的节目吧。\n听说评审非常严格，甚至有人会忍不住哭出来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"61d9a024f0b8e199f139e30bd16e108ce80a258a7e2a47ee0c9039868969836c","ja":"そうなの。気に入られないと、一口で残されたり、\n食べてもらえなかったりすることもあるみたい……。","zh":"是这样。如果不合口味，似乎也会被只吃一口就剩下，或者根本没被吃掉……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"6bdcdcbaf92c33dccb1585fbfa60e83ab2d81598be249fc8bd705d94eb937ca9","ja":"ええ～っ！？\nそれ、ちょっと厳しすぎない～！？","zh":"诶——！？\n这个要求是不是有点太严格了～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7f74142d0a75f69221e001c8473eeca0f27f14dbf0ca2e6110514d4ec9039b47","ja":"ほ、本当ですね……。番組に出るの、\nす、すごく勇気が、いりそう……。","zh":"真、真的呢……要上节目，\n好、好像需要非常大的勇气……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b9c4104acf791c039ad38b5bfee563250b706ea2a3304ee85a13d2846ca315ff","ja":"それに、なんだか、お料理もかわいそうで……。","zh":"而且，总觉得菜也挺可怜的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"eb0c3d310d3e386d828c3b9d29aeee4e24d15dbfb24752bbcf45d77d51558fd8","ja":"でも私が出たら、みんなの宣伝にもなると思うし。\n食べてもらえる最高の料理を作らなきゃ、って……。","zh":"不过，要是我出场的话，我觉得也能替大家宣传一下。\n所以……得做出能让大家吃到的最棒料理才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"e3b1e08a3a68cd606e97f9310be6c8e19787630d87052fa7b0fcdfe372da425b","ja":"それで考え込んで、スランプになったのですね。","zh":"所以才会苦思冥想，陷入低谷啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"43b69c8a73284121011d3b59f9e4b0af57b6f1b8825bbd7e76a4dfcc5f528187","ja":"うん……あ、でも大丈夫！\nもうちょっと、自分でしっかり考えてみるから。","zh":"嗯……啊，不过没关系！\n我会再自己好好想一想。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"07e34261a1ead09e3b18f2e18b4294ec22666a99b4f30a15f91927d4f106795a","ja":"佐竹さん。ひとりで抱えないでください。\n私としては、佐竹さんの選択を応援したいですが……。","zh":"佐竹小姐。请不要一个人扛着。\n\n就我而言，我想支持佐竹小姐的选择，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d3a9f9b4210719e4eb31988dd587ae229233adde94a08cfcb1bac8b4591f197a","ja":"笑顔で料理を作る姿が見られないのは\n寂しいです。……しょんぼり。","zh":"看不到你面带笑容做饭的样子，真让人寂寞……好失落。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"adab00ae72295998f75c32298e23f7423af383b209489fca70c565fd4cc47e67","ja":"えっ…………！","zh":"诶…………！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"ad35d5e26183db43b68c548110ef7e9309ba0ee8ebc06415d544c81233a426c6","ja":"わ、私も……美奈子さんのお料理、大好きだから……。\nだ、だから……無理しないで、欲しいです……。","zh":"我、我也是……因为最喜欢美奈子小姐做的料理了……。\n所、所以……希望你不要太勉强自己……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"46af2b3d5d932db05145f7b10f960c5015d116d29eb99e11d2d5aecf45327f0d","ja":"ワタシも！　それにミナコは知ってるでしょ？\n無理したら、見てるみんなにも伝わっちゃうって！","zh":"我也是！而且美奈子你也知道吧？\n要是勉强自己，正在看着的大家也会察觉到的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1808.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"834bd9cc1cbe225bcafdb47d3700a377c9366ff4db457fd96ad85f3a4464ab2b","ja":"だからミナコは、作りたいものを\n作りたい人に作ればいいんだヨ～！","zh":"所以美奈子想做什么，就做给想做的人就好啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
